		<defName>OAGene_Scenario_Snow</defName>
		<label>The orphan of the snowstorm</label>
		<description>After the blizzard, a helpless child struggled to climb out of the snow pile, but apart from the dazzling white snow, there was nothing else in the place.\nBlizzards continue to visit this barren land irregularly, forcing naive children to learn independence. Without familiar relatives and a town with smoke rising from cooking, this child was left with only two snow dogs she had encountered by chance. This was her only comfort in this helpless world.\nThis blizzard took away countless lives, but only the three of them remained. Is this luck or misfortune?\nThe answer is only known by herself and the gods.\n\nAttention: This is a high difficulty script with special weather phenomena, and it is not recommended for new players to try.\nAttention: This script will result in extreme blizzard weather and may also lead to cold wave blizzards, which can cause a significant drop in temperature. Please choose carefully.\nStarting with a cold plain and attempting to survive with a snow dog will provide the best immersion experience.\nIt is not recommended to use cultural ceremony recruitment.</description>
