	<ScenarioDef ParentName="ScenarioBase">
		<defName>OAGene_Scenario_Snow_Legacy</defName>
		<label>The orphan of the blizzard: frontier ruins</label>
		<description>Surviving the blizzard is only the first trial. This time, scattered across the frozen frontier are the wrecks of fallen ratkin settlements — the gold-gilded halls of Moustate, the blood-red banners of the Warlord, and the jade crypts of the lost state.\nA lone snow-ratkin orphan, barely a child, must not only weather the endless snowstorms but also decide the fate of these ruins: to carve out an independent kingdom, or to deliver the ancient relics to one of the ratkin powers in exchange for shelter.\n\nAttention: This is a high difficulty script with extreme blizzard weather and severe cold snaps. Not recommended for new players.\nBeginning on a cold plain with a snow dog and scavenging from ruins will provide the best immersion.\nIt is not recommended to use cultural ceremony recruitment.</description>
		<scenario>
